    {
      "bbox": [
        186,
        1041,
        1748,
        1361
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I have approved the employment of city employees as census enumerators to assist the U.S. Bureau of the Census. This work is important since the amount of state aid received by the city depends upon the city's population. Interested employees will be permitted to work for the Census Bureau between March 28 and April 15 and charge their absence from their city jobs to their annual leave balances, provided their agencies can spare them and there is no conflict of interest.",
