      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The period of training for Census Enumerators is: 3 hours per day, from 9 a.m. to 12 Noon or from 1:00 PM to 4:00 PM on March 28, 29 and 30. Training will be conducted near the enumer- ator's home. The salary for the 9 hours training period is $10.00.",
